BinExport for an R5900 program with an imposed function table: build basic blocks per function.
Used by docs/research/49-bindiff-crosscheck.md (Sprint 12, research Q4); its section 1.2 explains.

Against: google/binexport tag v12-20240417-ghidra_11.0.3, file
java/src/main/java/com/google/security/binexport/BinExport2Builder.java, run in Ghidra 11.0.3 with
ghidra-emotionengine-reloaded v2.1.16 (language r5900:LE:32:default). BinExport is Apache-2.0; this is a
diff of its source, and the patched file keeps its license header.

Two defects, both in BinExport2Builder:
  1. BasicBlockModel.getCodeBlocks() stops at the first R5900 `sync` instruction (0x0015dd10 in the SOCOM 1
     demo: 4,818 blocks of 119,015), so buildFlowGraphs looks up blocks it never indexed and throws a
     NullPointerException (BinExport2Builder.java:318).
  2. A function entered by fall-through sits inside a model block that starts in the previous function; its
     flow graph gets no entry block (index 0), and BinDiff 8 refuses the export
     ("AttachFlowGraph: flow graph already attached").
The fix: blocks are the model's blocks intersected with each function's body and split at its entry; an
edge to a block outside the function is dropped; a flow graph with no entry block is not written; the counts
go to the log ("BinExport2Builder PATCH: ...").

Apply and build (G = the Ghidra 11.0.3 install with the BinExport release extension unpacked in it):
  git clone --depth 1 --branch v12-20240417-ghidra_11.0.3 https://github.com/google/binexport
  cd binexport && git apply <repo>/ghidra_scripts/binexport-r5900-blocks.patch
  E=$G/Ghidra/Extensions/BinExport/lib; cp $E/BinExport.jar BinExport.jar.orig; mkdir -p classes
  javac -nowarn -d classes -cp "$(find $G/Ghidra -name '*.jar' | grep -v '/Debug/\|BinExport.jar' | tr '\n' ':')BinExport.jar.orig" \
      java/src/main/java/com/google/security/binexport/BinExport2Builder.java
  cp BinExport.jar.orig BinExport-patched.jar && (cd classes && jar uf ../BinExport-patched.jar com/google/security/binexport/*.class)
  cp BinExport-patched.jar $E/BinExport.jar
Also move $G/Ghidra/Debug/Framework-AsyncComm/lib/protobuf-java-3.21.8.jar out of $G: it shadows
BinExport's protobuf 3.25.1 (IllegalAccessError on the first export).

